      {
        "author": "Meagan T.",
        "date": "2025-10-28T22:31:59Z",
        "id": "690152b406f3f35414f358cb",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We had a lovely first stay in Watercolor in this home. The house was well equipped with everything we needed, clean, and had a nice modern layout. We loved that it was more private than others and backed to the trails instead of another home. The pool is a bit small but it’s very close to Camp Watercolor and we found that to be enjoyable. The LSV inclusion was an added benefit and we were able to get all around Watercolor and Seaside without our rental car which we would possibly forego next time. The host was also easily reachable when we had any questions. Highly recommend and plan to stay here again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Andrew C.",
        "date": "2025-06-23T14:21:07Z",
        "id": "685a25932118f51cd9ea9fce",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our family had a great trip to Watercolor and love staying at this home. The location was ideal--walking distance to Camp Watercolor and the Great Lawn but far enough away you don't hear it all. Kids loved having the trails right behind us to bike all over and go into Seaside. The house itself was gorgeous and so nice to have open air and sunshine on three sides. Will definitely stay here again.",
        "title": "Wonderful Home, Great Trip!"
      }
